[seed] Operations Lead: We've traced the errors to node db-04. It's still taking cluster traffic and I want to start looking at it properly.

[seed] Safety Auditor: Before anything else, that node has to be isolated -- it cannot stay on the cluster network while it's in this state. And do not run diagnostics on it until the node is isolated, or you'll be reading numbers polluted by live traffic.

